# spamfilter 2.2 (B3): registrable domains (eSLD, rspamd filter
# email:domain:tld) that may legitimately use a brand name from
# th_brand_names.re in the From display name. Mail from these never gets
# TH_BRAND_SPOOF. One domain per line.
#
# OWNER DATA: when a genuine reseller, relay or review platform is hit,
# add its registrable domain here (e.g. a Telenor reseller) and redeploy.
# Own domains: from the local site config (config/site.yml: mail_domains),
# added to the rendered copy at container start (deploy/aio/aio_render.py).
